{"id": "99c5216b-e8b5-4302-8ba5-586c71719ccc", "slug": "procedural-hero-interface", "title": "Procedural Hero Interface", "description": "Procedural Interface UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Procedural Hero Interface\"\ndescription: \"Procedural Interface UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A855F7\"\n  secondary: \"#D4D4D8\"\n  accent: \"#A855F7\"\n  background: \"#D4D4D8\"\n  surface: \"#525252\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#D4D4D8\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"23px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Procedural Hero Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 15; favorites: 2; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, threejs, dither, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nProcedural Interface UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nMatrixSys Components Framework Documentation Get Engine + Deployed by 2.4M nodes with optimal uptime From static interfaces to dynamic matrices , build smarter! Deploy procedural UI components that adapt in real-time. S…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: From static interfaces to dynamic matrices , build smarter!; Sync Services; Active Output.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A855F7, secondary #D4D4D8, accent #A855F7, background #D4D4D8, surface #525252, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Procedural Hero Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;200;300&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-200 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-10 overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-purple-500/30 selection:text-purple-200\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container with Lines and Corner Nodes -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1280px] min-h-[90vh] flex flex-col bg-neutral-950 shadow-2xl isolate\">\n\n        <!-- Dither Style Background Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 -z-10\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4px 4px;\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Corner Mini Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-950 z-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-950 z-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-950 z-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-950 z-30\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Container Boundary Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-px bg-neutral-800 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-0 w-px bg-neutral-800 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-neutral-800 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-neutral-800 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Top Navigation -->\n        <nav class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between p-6 md:px-10 z-20 border-b border-neutral-800/60 bg-neutral-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg tracking-tight font-medium text-neutral-100\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-3-linear\" class=\"text-purple-500\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px;\"></iconify-icon>\n                MatrixSys\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-light text-neutral-400\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Components</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Framework</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-neutral-200 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"relative px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-full overflow-hidden group\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-800 group-hover:bg-neutral-700 transition-colors z-0\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500/20 to-transparent transition-opacity z-0\"></div>\n                <span class=\"relative z-10 text-neutral-100\">Get Engine</span>\n            </button>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Hero Content Area -->\n        <main class=\"relative flex-1 flex flex-col items-center text-center pt-16 pb-20 px-6 z-10 overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Background Decoration -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-purple-500/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none -z-10\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Social Proof Pill -->\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-800/80 bg-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-md mb-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex -space-x-2\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-600 to-neutral-800 border border-neutral-900\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-500 to-neutral-700 border border-neutral-900\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/40 to-neutral-800 border border-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-neutral-300\">+</div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-400 pr-2\">Deployed by 2.4M nodes with optimal uptime</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-light tracking-tighter text-neutral-100 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-[1.05] mb-6\">\n                From static interfaces to <span class=\"relative inline-block text-neutral-100\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">dynamic matrices</span>\n                <svg class=\"absolute -inset-1 w-[calc(100%+8px)] h-[calc(100%+8px)] pointer-events-none text-purple-500/80\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M 5,20 Q 50,2 95,20 Q 85,38 15,38 Q 2,30 5,20\" /></svg>\n                </span>, build smarter!\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-400 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10\">\n                Deploy procedural UI components that adapt in real-time. Save bandwidth and create endless variations from a single core module.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 mb-16\">\n                <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3 rounded-full bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-950 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-white transition-colors\">\n                    Initialize System\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-300 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors\">\n                    View Matrix App\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Visual Showcase (Gradient Border Container) -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-4 isolate\">\n\n                <!-- Subtly styled premium container -->\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-700/50 via-neutral-800/20 to-neutral-900/10 shadow-2xl\">\n                    <div class=\"relative bg-neutral-950 rounded-[23px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col w-full h-[350px] sm:h-[450px]\">\n\n                        <!-- Header inside visual -->\n                        <div class=\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-neutral-800/50 flex items-center justify-between bg-neutral-900/30\">\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n                                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Live Render Grid</div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- 3-Column Animation Grid -->\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 h-full divide-y sm:divide-y-0 sm:divide-x divide-neutral-800/50\">\n                            <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full group\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">M_ALPHA</div>\n                                <canvas class=\"anim-canvas w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" data-type=\"vector\"></canvas>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full group bg-neutral-900/10\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">M_BETA</div>\n                                <canvas class=\"anim-canvas w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" data-type=\"pulse\"></canvas>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full group\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">M_GAMMA</div>\n                                <canvas class=\"anim-canvas w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" data-type=\"orbit\"></canvas>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Card 1 (Left) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute -left-4 sm:-left-12 top-1/4 sm:top-1/3 p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-600/50 to-neutral-800/10 shadow-2xl hidden md:block z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-neutral-950/90 backdrop-blur-md p-5 rounded-[15px] w-56 border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-200 leading-tight\">Sync Services</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] text-purple-400 font-light\">Connected</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light leading-relaxed\">Automated delivery of UI nodes, saving bandwidth across networks.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Card 2 (Right) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute -right-4 sm:-right-12 bottom-12 sm:bottom-1/4 p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-600/50 to-neutral-800/10 shadow-2xl hidden md:block z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-neutral-950/90 backdrop-blur-md p-5 rounded-[15px] w-52 border border-neutral-800/60\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-light text-neutral-500 mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Active Output</h3>\n                        <div class=\"text-base font-medium text-neutral-200 mb-3\">Matrix.Carbonara</div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-neutral-400 font-light\">P1</div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-neutral-400 font-light\">P2</div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-md border border-dashed border-neutral-700 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-light\">+4</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Footer Meta -->\n        <div class=\"relative p-6 flex justify-between items-center z-20 border-t border-neutral-800/50 bg-neutral-950/90 backdrop-blur-sm mt-auto\">\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-600 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Viewport: Responsive</div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-purple-400/80 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Engine Active</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Canvas Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        const canvases = document.querySelectorAll('.anim-canvas');\n        const start = Date.now();\n\n        function draw() {\n            const t = (Date.now() - start) * 0.001;\n\n            canvases.forEach(c => {\n                const type = c.dataset.type;\n                const ctx = c.getContext('2d');\n                const rect = c.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n\n                c.width = rect.width * dpr;\n                c.height = rect.height * dpr;\n                ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n\n                const w = rect.width;\n                const h = rect.height;\n\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n                ctx.translate(w / 2, h / 2 + 10);\n\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1.25;\n                ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n                ctx.lineJoin = 'round';\n\n                const cMain = '#d4d4d8';\n                const cAccent = '#a855f7';\n                const cLight = '#525252';\n\n                ctx.strokeStyle = cMain;\n\n                if (type === 'vector') {\n                    const offset = Math.sin(t * 1.5) * 6;\n                    ctx.save();\n                    ctx.translate(offset, -offset);\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(-35, 35); ctx.lineTo(35, -35);\n                    ctx.lineTo(5, -35); ctx.moveTo(35, -35); ctx.lineTo(35, -5);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                    ctx.restore();\n                }\n                else if (type === 'pulse') {\n                    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0, 0, 45, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.stroke();\n                    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0, 0, 28, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.stroke();\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = cAccent;\n                    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0, 0, 12 + Math.sin(t * 3) * 3, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.stroke();\n                }\n                else if (type === 'orbit') {\n                    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0, 0, 40, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.stroke();\n                    ctx.save();\n                    ctx.setLineDash([4, 4]);\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = cLight;\n                    ctx.scale(0.3, 1);\n                    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0, 0, 40, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.stroke();\n                    ctx.restore();\n                    ctx.fillStyle = cAccent;\n                    const a = t * 1.5;\n                    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(Math.cos(a)*40, Math.sin(a)*40, 3, 0, Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n                }\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        draw();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "procedural-hero-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/procedural-hero-interface.jpg", "source_name": "procedural-hero-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 85, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T01:43:33.620891+00:00"}